(2) Compute \lim_{n \rightarrow \infty} S_{n}\.", "Step 5": "[CONDITION] Recursive formula for \( S_n \) established. [PROCESS] Sum the series from \( S_0 \) to \( S_n \): \( S_n = 1 + \sum_{k=0}^{n-1} \frac{3}{4} \left(\frac{4}{9}\right)^k \). [CONCLUSION] \( S_n = 1 + \frac{3}{4} \cdot \frac{1 - \left(\frac{4}{9}\right)^{n}}{1 - \frac{4}{9}} \)"}

